    "argv": "The npm wrapper launch binary is byte-identical to 2.1.319; `cli-wrapper.cjs` and `install.cjs` are also byte-identical. `--input-format text`, `--output-format stream-json`, `--tools \"\"`, `--safe-mode`, and strict empty MCP remain exact.",
